          "Overall Sonic Palette",
          "The album's sonic identity is built on a fundamental conflict. It will blend organic, raw, folk-like instrumentation—acoustic guitars, upright pianos, mournful strings—to represent the human element, the individual stories, and the communities at the heart of the narrative. This organic sound will be progressively corrupted, interrupted, and ultimately overwhelmed by a cold, digital, and industrial soundscape. This opposing palette will consist of distorted drum machines, harsh and clinical synthesizers, metallic percussion, and processed vocals. This sonic battle is not just an aesthetic choice; it is a direct musical metaphor for the album's central theme of human value being crushed by systemic, mechanized forces.",
