        "\"WHEN THE BOOKS ARE BALANCED. WHAT ARE WE WORTH?\" The final track of 'Sold Cheap' is a summation of our entire argument. A thank you to everyone who has taken this journey with us. #SoldCheapAlbum @TheShadyRiverBard #NewMusicFriday #Folk #Rock #ProtestMusic",
